### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Database health
GET http://localhost:3000/health/database

### Admin login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@2124"
}

### Check admin session
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/auth/me

### Admin stats
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/stats
x-admin-api-secret: 0ae51951d8bb4f8a202a6993f601da6c6edafc5fb006253aa0992075cda2625a

### Create a draft draw
POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/draws
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-api-secret: 0ae51951d8bb4f8a202a6993f601da6c6edafc5fb006253aa0992075cda2625a

{
  "drawCode": "TEST-DRAW-001",
  "drawDateText": "ጥቅምት 15/2018 ዓ.ም",
  "notes": "Development test only. Not an official draw."
}

### List draws
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/draws
x-admin-api-secret: 0ae51951d8bb4f8a202a6993f601da6c6edafc5fb006253aa0992075cda2625a

### Add a prize (replace DRAW_ID)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/draws/DRAW_ID/prizes
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-api-secret: 0ae51951d8bb4f8a202a6993f601da6c6edafc5fb006253aa0992075cda2625a

{
  "prizeName": "1ኛ ሽልማት",
  "winningNumber": "123-4567890",
  "prizeAmount": "100000.00",
  "currency": "ETB",
  "sortOrder": 1
}

### Verify draw (replace DRAW_ID)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/draws/DRAW_ID/verify
x-admin-api-secret: 0ae51951d8bb4f8a202a6993f601da6c6edafc5fb006253aa0992075cda2625a

### Publish draw — matches tickets and notifies winners (replace DRAW_ID)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/draws/DRAW_ID/publish
x-admin-api-secret: 0ae51951d8bb4f8a202a6993f601da6c6edafc5fb006253aa0992075cda2625a

### Re-run matching for published draw (replace DRAW_ID)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/admin/draws/DRAW_ID/match
x-admin-api-secret: 0ae51951d8bb4f8a202a6993f601da6c6edafc5fb006253aa0992075cda2625a

### List winners (replace DRAW_ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/draws/DRAW_ID/winners
x-admin-api-secret: 0ae51951d8bb4f8a202a6993f601da6c6edafc5fb006253aa0992075cda2625a

### List tickets
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/tickets?limit=20
x-admin-api-secret: 0ae51951d8bb4f8a202a6993f601da6c6edafc5fb006253aa0992075cda2625a

### List winners only
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/tickets?winnersOnly=true
x-admin-api-secret: 0ae51951d8bb4f8a202a6993f601da6c6edafc5fb006253aa0992075cda2625a

### List users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users?limit=20
x-admin-api-secret: 0ae51951d8bb4f8a202a6993f601da6c6edafc5fb006253aa0992075cda2625a

